Scoped cas (contrast adaptive sharpen) video filter

The option table (strength, planes), the pixel_fmts list, the plane geometry of
config_input, lerpf and the single-precision cas_slice8 kernel (clamped 3x3
neighbourhood, min/max sums, sqrtf amplitude, weighted mean converted to int
and clipped by av_clip_uint8, unselected planes copied) in
src/video-ops/cas.ts follow libavfilter/vf_cas.c (cas_options, pixel_fmts,
config_input, lerpf, cas_slice8, filter_frame). The AV_OPT_TYPE_FLOAT range
check and float store and the AV_OPT_TYPE_FLAGS +/- term folding follow
libavutil/opt.c (set_string_number, write_number).
